message: "If you use this resource, please cite the version you used."
type: software
title: "Conversational specimen identification"
abstract: >-
  Instructions, method notes, and a portable record format for using a
  conversational AI system as a companion during observer-led biological
  specimen examination and identification. Generative AI tools assisted the
  development and revision of the resource. Paul J. Palmer directed and
  reviewed the work and accepts responsibility for its contents.
